      <h1 class="article-title">The Athanasian Creed</h1>
      <p class="article-dek faith-doc-dek">c. 5th–6th Century</p>
      
      <p class="faith-doc-description">The most thorough ecumenical creed on the Trinity and the Incarnation.</p>
      
      
